{"id":"vod_bf_21857","vodId":"21857","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"漫画家与助手们","name_cn":"漫画家与助手们","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-23/33791b5fd3bf0702a1dd689e23f74665.jpg"},"summary":"本剧围绕着有妄想症、喜欢画女孩子内裤的漫画家爱徒勇气（松冈祯丞 配音），以及他的美女助手足须沙穗都（早见沙织 配音）、新人助手兼忠实粉丝风羽玲奈、超级助手黑井濑奈、还有他的责任编辑音砂见张，描绘了“变态”漫画家和美女助手们的后宫日常。爱徒勇气长着一张还算清秀的俊脸，可惜是个变态，因为想受到女性欢迎而成为漫画家，结果完全不是那么一回事。他非常喜欢在漫画作品里画内裤，还经常对助手们提出各种各样奇怪的要求，让她们感到困扰。不仅如此，他还喜欢偷懒，经常拖稿，给他的责任编辑也添了不少麻烦。美少女助手和超级助手，责任编辑以及美女主编逐一登场，爱徒勇气被她们围绕着，在一个美好的后宫环境下工作。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:42:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/manhuajiayuzhushoumen/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:48:50.354Z"}